# Source footage lives here but must never be committed — the originals were
# 4K60 at 15-17 MB, which would be minutes of download on a Bangladeshi mobile
# connection and would sit in git history forever even if deleted later.
#
# Only web-encoded derivatives ship: 1080p, no audio, and as small as the
# footage allows. hero-1 is the lighter of the two and loads first.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
!hero-1.mp4
!hero-2.mp4
